   "node_type": "section",
   "text": "\\section{Softmax over a stream}\nAttention computes a softmax over the scores $s_1, \\dots, s_N$ of one query against $N$ keys and averages the values $v_j$ with these weights.\nA naive implementation stores all scores before normalising. The online method processes the scores in blocks and keeps a small running state.\n\n",
