   "text": "\\begin{definition}\nFor a block $B$ of keys define the state $(m_B, \\ell_B, o_B)$ with $m_B = \\max_{j \\in B} s_j$, $\\ell_B = \\sum_{j \\in B} e^{s_j - m_B}$ and $o_B = \\sum_{j \\in B} e^{s_j - m_B} v_j$.\n\\end{definition}\n\n% \\section{An unfinished section that is commented out}\n\n",
