   "text": "\\begin{lemma}\\label{lem:merge}\nFor disjoint blocks $A$ and $B$, with $m = \\max(m_A, m_B)$, the state of $A \\cup B$ is\n$\\ell = e^{m_A - m}\\ell_A + e^{m_B - m}\\ell_B$ and $o = e^{m_A - m} o_A + e^{m_B - m} o_B$.\n\\end{lemma}\n",
