  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 4,
   "node_type": "proof",
   "text": "\\begin{proof}[Proof of Lemma~\\ref{lem:merge}]\nEvery term of $\\ell_A$ has the form $e^{s_j - m_A}$. Multiplying by $e^{m_A - m}$ turns it into $e^{s_j - m}$, and the same holds for $B$.\nThe sum over $A \\cup B$ is therefore the sum of the rescaled block sums. The argument for $o$ is identical, with each term multiplied by $v_j$.\n\\end{proof}",
